  "description": "The Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite Pod Kit is a sleek and lightweight device designed for vapers seeking a high-quality MTL (mouth-to-lung) experience. The Caliburn G3 Lite is equipped with a 750mAh built-in battery, ensuring long-lasting power throughout the day. The device supports USB-C fast charging, minimizing downtime and keeping you vaping on the go. The ergonomic design of the Caliburn G3 Lite ensures comfort and ease of use, making it a perfect choice for both new and experienced vapers. Available in a variety of vibrant colours, this compact and portable device combines style and functionality in one. The refillable 2ml pods are designed for convenience and simplicity, featuring a top-fill system to make refills quick and mess-free. The Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite utilizes Pro-FOCS flavour adjustment technology, delivering rich, full-bodied flavour with every puff. This technology ensures that your e-liquid’s taste is maximized, providing a consistently enjoyable vape. The device is compatible with Uwell’s G-Pod Platform Compatible which offers multiple resistance pods for a variety of MTL & RDL (restricted direct-to-lung) experiences. We recommend pairing this with 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquids. Please Note: Charging cable is not supplied. A USB-C Charging Cable can be purchased separately. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
